Root cause:
The bug was caused by the absence of the "color" attribute in the device tree for the Ux500 HREF LEDs, which was required for proper probing. This attribute was introduced in a previous commit that added multicolor framework support, but the device tree was not updated accordingly, leading to probe failures when attempting to read the color property. The patch fixes this by defining the color attributes for the LEDs in the device tree.
